# Practice on a DPR-3 phone held sideways: easy difficulty with undo; place the
# piston, undo it, place it again, fast-forward the settle, finish.
# viewport 844x390@3
frames 150
touch =Practice
frames 20
touch Easy — extra tool stock
frames 10
touch =Start practicing
frames 20
until 600 =Pause
frames 330
save p-play
touch Wallop Piston, 2 available
frames 10
touch 420 200
frames 10
expect Undo
touch =↩ Undo  U
frames 10
expect Wallop Piston, 2 available
touch Wallop Piston, 2 available
frames 10
touch 420 200
frames 10
touch =Trigger Wallop Piston
frames 20
save p-fired
repeat 2000 until =🗺 Stages
frames 10
end
frames 30
save p-results
